      "standardized_narrative": "For 2024, Apollo Syndicate 1969 reported a gross prior year reserve strengthening of $58.972 million, representing 6.54% of its opening gross claims outstanding. This adverse development was primarily driven by reserving reviews for Non-Marine Liability and Marine & Energy Liability, adverse incurred claims development on prior accident years across several classes including Aviation, Marine Hull, Offshore Energy, Non-Marine Liability, and Marine & Energy Liability. The negative impact of litigation financing, large single claimant settlements, and US court awards on the Non-Marine Liability class also contributed to the strengthening. Specific strengthening was noted for the Marine & Energy Liability class for 2021 and prior years of account due to adverse claims experience.",
